rf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Bastrop County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. June to July came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025, Nov-Dec came in at 27% of normal on the middle. In 2026 so far, Jan-Feb sat at 39% and Apr-May at 153% on the middle.</p>"}
